                <syl /><neume facs="#m-49b6ea2f-fe32-4341-9af6-c312c05454a3" type="punctum" xml:id="m-e60f068e-86cc-4419-b6c5-0329ffa703e1">
                  <nc xml:id="m-9568efaa-deb0-442e-ac47-bcfbc9475a1e" pname="a" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-f1574a33-8fa2-4683-a79d-d85191cde0f6" facs="#m-db1c7738-8749-4522-8bf1-612d389966c3" form="maior" /><custos xml:id="m-5c02e5e4-0e89-4f5c-97aa-80657eec40d1" facs="#m-38980828-0dfd-45bd-aaa4-03f3dacc01c2" pname="b" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-628191bd-6cd7-4c26-9b59-63a25ba57a9a"><lg xml:id="m-a0943e3d-9d44-4e58-aa8e-fb07a0fe9999"><l xml:id="m-7fee8083-0fcb-4421-b2bb-45f55f8b5b41" facs="#m-9fbc0101-8267-4cb1-bf1f-4739eb203a92" label="ambiguous">1710</l><l xml:id="m-a177fb3c-89ab-44ff-8c72-7a86140abbb8" facs="#m-01023dfc-5a5c-483e-86be-87e7b22799ba" label="text-like">Feast of Our Lord Jesus Christ, King.</l><l xml:id="m-bc59a48d-4c8b-45aa-b5d3-44add052e28d" facs="#m-b32fc721-7a6e-4382-bad2-c8a105f539d0" label="lyrics-like">li-o Régis. Gló-ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-cbb48c74-7bf5-4c47-bf42-5851682df27d" facs="#m-a2a85f8d-ce49-43ff-a0fa-e0fcec7789c9" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-5982d013-5ddb-4f02-9860-e0db894f18b0" facs="#m-1f0c0cce-ebda-4fcf-a391-6a1edc3f226c" label="lyrics-like">Mnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui lliae Géntium, peccáti vúlnere dis¬</l><l xml:id="m-08cd1071-d886-4312-9576-4217bdb38fc0" facs="#m-716b2bea-9037-4d93-9246-1bdc7cc1a890" label="lyrics-like">gregátae, "ejus suavissimo subdán¬</l><l xml:id="m-58a6cc9c-d1fc-4dad-b7a5-a32f95f03e3f" facs="#m-e84147dd-f5d6-4979-a517-248a599934bc" label="lyrics-like">U in dilécto Filio tuo, universórum</l><l xml:id="m-3515115d-9938-4e7a-a5d2-ca63de9a4dc1" facs="#m-0006dc21-ec2a-47e0-be55-2a37fcf30c1d" label="lyrics-like">tur império: Qui tecum.</l><l xml:id="m-90810b0b-ddc2-4acd-8348-18b6e56fa8d8" facs="#m-79db4bc9-e2e5-4d86-a8f7-bb734b4845b2" label="lyrics-like">Rege, ómnia instauráre voluisti:!</l><l xml:id="m-555352fa-66a3-474f-befd-6759d1718fa4" facs="#m-a91fab2f-8708-4b43-a626-50142acd825d" label="lyrics-like">concéde propitius; ut cunctae famí¬</l><l xml:id="m-c97adcf6-5d27-4f24-a64d-74df9c8b1ac4" facs="#m-03fa5d32-bb97-4f00-9f6c-21d5c04858c0" label="text-like">A commemoration is made of the Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-f6f0ef23-d091-4c88-9221-9676e2a42be3" facs="#m-40765d96-1958-4f92-9c92-50ea333c0a57" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Colossenses. Coloss. I.</l><l xml:id="m-d4ff4372-b56a-475a-90e0-8f86210a24fa" facs="#m-8388abe8-2739-43e0-a47d-f44140809ca6" label="lyrics-like">L'Ratres: Grátias ágimus Deo ipsum, et in ipso creáta sunt, et ipse</l><l xml:id="m-116f4141-b9d3-45e2-aa28-bfb2ea9aff90" facs="#m-708d7a9f-eba1-4ebf-a99e-ba6a657ebec2" label="lyrics-like">est ante omnes, et ómnia in ipso</l><l xml:id="m-c91cd284-d6fe-463e-92c9-18f79b001fb4" facs="#m-6392cb47-7cc7-4d88-bfcb-b00429f86763" label="ambiguous">Patri, qui dignos nos fecit in</l><l xml:id="m-1ef2a8cf-9999-49c4-804b-fc1298fbdef9" facs="#m-9315bdf3-7d5e-40a2-84aa-5567bde987be" label="lyrics-like">constant. Et ipse est caput córporis</l><l xml:id="m-65c1786f-a364-4324-9f06-d3ab4f55f280" facs="#m-b780b8b3-a794-411a-b319-676c84df35c4" label="lyrics-like">partem sortis sanctórum in lúmine,</l><l xml:id="m-4145f8da-ecb3-42cb-a104-4f8fb444f387" facs="#m-b6e21760-1f82-4cd3-90e4-d2b435b3e929" label="lyrics-like">Ecclésiae, qui est princípium, pri¬</l><l xml:id="m-9f3141f1-a554-4fc8-b853-7b524d8f084a" facs="#m-c911b02b-3b8a-467a-8c27-187abeae9eaf" label="lyrics-like">qui erípuit nos de potestáte tene¬</l><l xml:id="m-83f23968-af8c-4eb7-9d5b-0db2a6c96b6b" facs="#m-c6ef7a96-804b-4ac6-b457-1621ceb73487" label="lyrics-like">mogénitus ex mórtuis, ut sit in</l><l xml:id="m-069a02ab-4534-41eb-9fb0-37c8861064f7" facs="#m-d27b1982-26d6-4597-8fe7-423ef6770d99" label="lyrics-like">brárum, et tránstulit in regnum Filii</l><l xml:id="m-9469dbae-c2b4-4caf-abfe-775f22750230" facs="#m-e786d354-6daf-4631-afec-f9a49299579d" label="lyrics-like">ómnibus ipse primátum tenens;</l><l xml:id="m-fb078ecb-bb3e-43a9-93b0-ae14a866f27e" facs="#m-f2692db0-f177-4123-9612-0d6bf55de39c" label="lyrics-like">dilectiónis suae, in quo habémus</l><l xml:id="m-ecbf5868-c4a3-4b7d-b18d-413a0b52e24d" facs="#m-7b908eb7-555e-41ad-9596-32a04ead83d8" label="lyrics-like">quia in ipso complácuit omnem ple¬</l><l xml:id="m-547c020f-e534-4721-813f-5b6012bbb65b" facs="#m-bd559000-48d5-49a6-ba0b-a88df147cafe" label="lyrics-like">redemptiónem per sánguinem ejus,</l><l xml:id="m-11042e36-78a6-44ab-8c1c-27ef7ec882ef" facs="#m-feb965b3-ab33-4dc0-945d-03a73c89a234" label="lyrics-like">nitúdinem inhabitáre, et per eum</l><l xml:id="m-efe80042-aa2f-4d7e-9354-1599fa702525" facs="#m-90a1cc72-d997-4f3e-b27c-d252fab92a8a" label="lyrics-like">remissiónem peccatórum: qui est</l><l xml:id="m-e3c3f8f3-5a4f-4250-823e-9c07a1acc3fe" facs="#m-99e61fe9-3b58-42f7-81e7-067d279c0e2a" label="lyrics-like">imágo Dei invisibilis, primogénitus</l><l xml:id="m-0e6cb457-e4c0-4cec-b3cf-29ce92f01767" facs="#m-79af8d37-35e5-4b32-833d-a6e8167d0074" label="lyrics-like">reconciliâre ómnia in ipsum, pací¬</l><l xml:id="m-e0f73044-f919-4fb9-b02b-4ce89cc8070a" facs="#m-ced5ba54-56a7-4bec-88bb-1f41f4d2b499" label="lyrics-like">ficans per sánguinem crucis ejus,</l><l xml:id="m-b1445407-a5bf-463a-8477-e407094a3258" facs="#m-dc5438f8-31a8-4d05-9c17-0a6a35a19188" label="lyrics-like">omnis creatúrae; quóniam in ipso</l><l xml:id="m-5774130f-ea9d-457e-a550-eae9f145ef3a" facs="#m-70f3b473-91f6-4299-b8f5-6f1ffebd57e2" label="ambiguous">sive quae in terris, sive quae in</l><l xml:id="m-af65f455-77cf-45b6-b348-8cd4f20e4325" facs="#m-e757044a-a2a0-4004-b7e3-c953f85b9c7a" label="lyrics-like">cóndita sunt univérsa in caelis et</l><l xml:id="m-8152ab39-ef75-4567-912c-8fc8ac4b3293" facs="#m-3dcfd697-4f71-48ec-bef6-9baa61beff5e" label="ambiguous">in terra, visibilia et invisibilia, sive</l><l xml:id="m-aab3d319-c303-4879-a24d-bcbcaf9f0e23" facs="#m-c5840eab-d1cb-489e-b75a-dc8d84959951" label="lyrics-like">caelis sunt, in Christo Jesu Dómino</l><l xml:id="m-f2bea4af-17ae-46d2-b30e-58a5dafdc0a6" facs="#m-f14dea24-4456-4831-89ff-d827fb3150a9" label="lyrics-like">throni, sive dominatiónes, sive prin¬</l><l xml:id="m-2b78ae60-eed5-443a-b6be-039939ba009d" facs="#m-4bffe929-0bbf-47d3-8198-c5865da8e37f" label="ambiguous">nostro.</l><l xml:id="m-2e9c0c7b-160b-4161-a938-cb0ba820adca" facs="#m-7eba4f71-c898-47eb-a616-bceb3140b5ca" label="lyrics-like">cipátus, sive potestátes: ómnia per</l><l xml:id="m-715cdedd-e170-4093-9b94-b8f51a04ce03" facs="#m-db618074-710e-43aa-b2b9-96d97bea53b3" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-3a268a7b-ae67-4ab1-ae5b-281bdefdc045" facs="#m-623e324c-438f-40f7-af8f-e28385e33737" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-8b589f9c-ffe1-4a82-b553-9fabe1207332" facs="#m-74eb22d1-6a2f-4884-9fd6-0dd8d059262f" label="lyrics-like">Dominá¬</l><l xml:id="m-a0a8eefc-5182-450d-b25c-a24eac0f96c3" facs="#m-cd828df5-7a66-44d2-98c8-a39586e05ec9" label="lyrics-like">bi-tur" a má- ri us¬</l><l xml:id="m-a74df492-89d1-45aa-ac34-561420b01d7d" facs="#m-34553509-1ab2-44a6-bc2a-2010fa872d9c" label="ambiguous">que</l><l xml:id="m-538e0c3e-4f4e-45e7-9602-07b40520f680" facs="#m-d7e450b9-c5f4-441f-8c7c-2f6597448565" label="lyrics-like">ad má-re, et a flúmi-ne</l><l xml:id="m-b8efb443-4e80-4ec6-b6b8-cfae3a33ae83" facs="#m-abec9449-a185-4c5d-9184-d52e5762792a" label="lyrics-like">usque ad términos</l><l xml:id="m-ee8c597a-9576-481f-bce6-5db867d482e1" facs="#m-dc2b3e1e-823f-47b2-863b-f0606edea7bd" label="lyrics-like">V. Et ado-rábunt é¬</l><l xml:id="m-e6f59ba9-cfda-47c7-ba01-351f41b59422" facs="#m-ad7efb4f-70ff-4278-9c23-44ce588ce453" label="lyrics-like">ór- bis terrá-rum.</l><l xml:id="m-3ecb91d5-fc56-4a98-b98a-52c56e332eaf" facs="#m-a5945810-f59f-4bc0-8056-1a14c24b7f37" label="lyrics-like">ómnes</l><l xml:id="m-071254dd-d7c8-4867-a137-4e764b8a6869" facs="#m-09fcf9c6-0f4b-4972-82f1-dcb1fb90316d" label="ambiguous">um</l><l xml:id="m-461d5c26-a2b9-4bb6-a4b4-9d0b835c01d4" facs="#m-235ca635-41ab-4b59-bb09-07a3616f4a92" label="lyrics-like">6- mnes Gén¬</l><l xml:id="m-a6b930c4-1c7b-4873-98bf-de356944230a" facs="#m-e3cb185f-ec97-4e7f-b722-6f9ad3f03175" label="ambiguous">tes</l><l xml:id="m-c2083a37-4f2b-4a7d-931a-d0bf00df2458" facs="#m-be170342-3546-4eb5-8c4f-9d8ec1c2d867" label="lyrics-like">ré-ges tér-rae:</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>